[[General:Saltatio Mortis - Pray To The Hunter feat. „The Elder Scrolls Online"|''Pray to the Hunter'']] is a song and music video created by the band [[Wikipedia:Saltatio Mortis|Saltatio Mortis]] to advertise ''[[Online:High Isle (Chapter)|The Elder Scrolls Online: High Isle]]''. The lyrics feature various references to ''[[General:The Elder Scrolls|Elder Scrolls]]'' lore, and uses [[Lore:Dragon Language|Dragon Language]] in the chorus. The music video narrative portrays the [[Lore:Three Banners War|Three Alliances]] battling the [[Lore:Ascendant Order|Ascendant Order]] outside a village set upon by the order's forces.

